[{"knowledge_point": {"db_id": 17592186119815, "id": "f892805c-2c2c-5105-91ba-353aefe7b7f2", "title": "Finding a Basis of the Space Spanned by a Set of Vectors Using Inspection"}, "question": {":question/id": "9aee22ef-69ac-54d0-882c-02a197dd057f", ":question/problem": "Consider the vectors\n\n$$\n\\mathbf{a}_{1}=\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix},\\qquad \\mathbf{a}_{2}=\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 6\\end{bmatrix},\\qquad \\mathbf{a}_{3}=\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 4\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nFind bases of $S=\\operatorname{Span}\\{\\mathbf{a}_1,\\mathbf{a}_2,\\mathbf{a}_3\\}$ by inspection. **Select every set that is a basis of $S$.**", ":question/worked-solution": "A **basis** must be linearly independent and span $S$.\n\nAll nonzero vectors point along one direction:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\mathbf{a}_{3}&=(2)\\mathbf{a}_{1} \\\\ \\mathbf{a}_{2}&=(3)\\mathbf{a}_{1}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nEvery nonzero singleton is independent and spans $S$. The zero singleton cannot span this nonzero space. Any set of two or three displayed vectors is dependent.\n\nTherefore, select exactly these bases:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\mathcal{B}_{1}&=\\{\\mathbf{a}_{1}\\} \\\\ \\mathcal{B}_{2}&=\\{\\mathbf{a}_{2}\\} \\\\ \\mathcal{B}_{3}&=\\{\\mathbf{a}_{3}\\}\\end{aligned}\n$$", ":question/difficulty": ":question.difficulty/easy", ":question/answer-fields": [{":answer-field/id": "58a80ba8-5be6-59b8-b79a-dda6b28b9b96", ":answer-field/key": "$\\{\\mathbf{a}_{2},\\mathbf{a}_{3}\\}$", ":answer-field/type": ":answer-field.type/checkbox", ":answer-field/choices": [{":answer/id": "f8c7d7cd-8df4-5535-9ddc-a877ee6646c7", ":answer/type": ":answer.type/text", ":answer/value": "false"}, {":answer/id": "e4fc18ec-6542-56a5-9c51-b6195ee3cab7", ":answer/type": ":answer.type/text", ":answer/value": "true"}], ":answer-field/correct": [":answer/id", "f8c7d7cd-8df4-5535-9ddc-a877ee6646c7"]}, {":answer-field/id": "78f6cd35-e948-5cf8-bf4c-28bf3a659aab", ":answer-field/key": "$\\{\\mathbf{a}_{1},\\mathbf{a}_{3}\\}$", ":answer-field/type": ":answer-field.type/checkbox", ":answer-field/choices": [{":answer/id": "7131e564-5bb1-5111-8a40-0e70ca4d1617", ":answer/type": ":answer.type/text", ":answer/value": "false"}, {":answer/id": "d6ce6bb8-0a56-58c8-bbcd-12148bcce9dc", ":answer/type": ":answer.type/text", ":answer/value": "true"}], ":answer-field/correct": [":answer/id", "7131e564-5bb1-5111-8a40-0e70ca4d1617"]}, {":answer-field/id": "74ff7b60-29ac-5aec-b3d3-4e60d1bcda48", ":answer-field/key": "$\\{\\mathbf{a}_{1},\\mathbf{a}_{2},\\mathbf{a}_{3}\\}$", ":answer-field/type": ":answer-field.type/checkbox", ":answer-field/choices": [{":answer/id": "ee3595af-4b20-5d29-9985-8cbdf5e1f81d", ":answer/type": ":answer.type/text", ":answer/value": "false"}, {":answer/id": "9027e0fe-60d7-5f5c-9cf8-04b157e9f13a", ":answer/type": ":answer.type/text", ":answer/value": "true"}], ":answer-field/correct": [":answer/id", "ee3595af-4b20-5d29-9985-8cbdf5e1f81d"]}, {":answer-field/id": "9eb23500-5a7c-51c9-978c-d0bc76353809", ":answer-field/key": "$\\{\\mathbf{a}_{1},\\mathbf{a}_{2}\\}$", ":answer-field/type": ":answer-field.type/checkbox", ":answer-field/choices": [{":answer/id": "9cf45950-d32b-5cff-82af-ffc8ba8fe64e", ":answer/type": ":answer.type/text", ":answer/value": "false"}, {":answer/id": "dabd8344-6a53-53e0-8c7c-221c88eadd9a", ":answer/type": ":answer.type/text", ":answer/value": "true"}], ":answer-field/correct": [":answer/id", "9cf45950-d32b-5cff-82af-ffc8ba8fe64e"]}, {":answer-field/id": "54e5ccd6-c34c-5d0d-8964-7bba7ccfc46a", ":answer-field/key": "$\\{\\mathbf{a}_{1}\\}$", ":answer-field/type": ":answer-field.type/checkbox", ":answer-field/choices": [{":answer/id": "4450edcd-ade4-5e7a-b704-df15b4c0842f", ":answer/type": ":answer.type/text", ":answer/value": "false"}, {":answer/id": "0b517762-54d8-5fc1-806f-772edb969e52", ":answer/type": ":answer.type/text", ":answer/value": "true"}], ":answer-field/correct": [":answer/id", "0b517762-54d8-5fc1-806f-772edb969e52"]}, {":answer-field/id": "da42e41c-