trix}.\n$$\n\nFind bases of $S=\\operatorname{Span}\\{\\mathbf{a}_1,\\mathbf{a}_2,\\mathbf{a}_3\\}$ by inspection. **Select every set that is a basis of $S$.**", ":question/worked-solution": "A **basis** must be linearly independent and span $S$.\n\nAll nonzero vectors point along one direction:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\mathbf{a}_{3}&=(2)\\mathbf{a}_{2} \\\\ \\mathbf{a}_{1}&=(0)\\mathbf{a}_{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nEvery nonzero singleton is independent and spans $S$. The zero singleton cannot span this nonzero space. Any set of two or three displayed vectors is dependent.\n\nTherefore, select exactly these bases:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\mathcal{B}_{1}&=\\{\\mathbf{a}_{2}\\} \\\\ \\mathcal{B}_{2}&=\\{\\mathbf{a}_{3}\\}\\end{aligned}\n$$", ":question/difficulty": ":question.difficulty/easy", ":question/answer-fields": [{":answer-field/id": "a82ccd9d-8c46-5f22-8509-553e986f2b30", ":answer-field/key": "$\\{\\mathbf{a}_{1},\\mathbf{a}_{2}\\}$", ":answer-field/type": ":answer-field.type/checkbox", ":answer-field/choices": [{":answer/id": "22b3247a-e357-5a0f-91d0-4be6f4d226b6", ":answer/type": ":answer.type/text", ":answer/value": "false"}, {":answer/id": "e0e8eb23-b74e-576e-8c23-c80ac6de10e8", ":answer/type": ":answer.type/text", ":answer/value": "true"}], ":answer-field/correct": [":answer/id", "22b3247a-e357-5a0f-91d0-4be6f4d226b6"]}, {":answer-field/id": "4ae5072c-6a88-548f-9da3-f60f533061bc", ":answer-field/key": "$\\{\\mathbf{a}_{1},\\mathbf{a}_{2},\\mathbf{a}_{3}\\}$", ":answer-field/type": ":answer-field.type/checkbox", ":answer-field/choices": [{":answer/id": "83e80d1a-193c-5c70-8324-455e9d65847f", ":answer/type": ":answer.type/text", ":answer/value": "false"}, {":answer/id": "90955b02-3392-5c3b-8b82-164c562a5da1", ":answer/type": ":answer.type/text", ":answer/value": "true"}], ":answer-field/correct": [":answer/id", "83e80d1a-193c-5c70-8324-455e9d65847f"]}, {":answer-field/id": "a0a1583b-1888-5809-b26e-7428c65eb177", ":answer-field/key": "$\\{\\mathbf{a}_{1}\\}$